---
doc: {title: "bib: параметри документа", language: uk-UA}
params: {bib_order: given}
---
|% The setting of the library comes from the parameter of the document: param("bib_order").
|import("../bib")
|code:
sources = [
    {"key": "b", "type": "web", "title": "Б", "url": "u"},
    {"key": "a", "type": "web", "title": "А", "url": "u"},
]
reg = bib.registry(sources)
if reg["keys"] != ["b", "a"]:
    fail("bib_order=given: отримано " + str(reg["keys"]))
if bib.registry(sources, order="alphabet")["keys"] != ["a", "b"]:
    fail("явний order має перевагу")
|end
Перевірено.
